        "client_msg_id": "1bc64261-2eaa-4de2-8acf-7f94879608bb",
        "text": "<@UDRF3ALP4> it depends on what are you looking at and what are you looking for. Some things are best to be looked at top-down, for others side-by-side does the job. That's why in this spy it is on-demand, as well as collapsed or not.\nAlso it is info-per-space management: top-down-only and sideways-only are 1D, both-on-demand - 2D, add folding and it is 2.5D",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1731109091.361599",
        "parent_user_id": "UDRF3ALP4",
        "blocks": [
            {
