                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " it depends on what are you looking at and what are you looking for. Some things are best to be looked at top-down, for others side-by-side does the job. That's why in this spy it is on-demand, as well as collapsed or not.\nAlso it is info-per-space management: top-down-only and sideways-only are 1D, both-on-demand - 2D, add folding and it is 2.5D"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
