        "client_msg_id": "3308217e-0654-4693-b70e-0e9a52ef8bc9",
        "text": "just in case:\nclick on `[]{}()\"` - cycles between collapsed, vertical, horizontal views\ncmd+click - clicks on all siblings simultaneously\nalt+click - clicks on all similar xpaths, eg value under same key in a list of maps.\n\nthis way you dont have to click on every collection item to lay it out to your liking",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1731109091.361599",
        "parent_user_id": "UDRF3ALP4",
        "blocks": [
